    "title": "File:The Beulé Gate on May 19, 2020.jpg",
    "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/The_Beul%C3%A9_Gate_on_May_19%2C_2020.jpg",
    "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Beul%C3%A9_Gate_on_May_19,_2020.jpg",
    "width": 6000,
